  "title": "Invizyne Technologies Announces Name Change to eXoZymes, Inc. and New Ticker Symbol",
  "summary": "Trading Under New Ticker of “EXOZ” Expected to Begin February 12, 2025. Monrovia, CA, Feb. 10, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Today, Invizyne Technologies, Inc., (NASDAQ: IZTC) (“Invizyne”), a leading designer of cell-free, enzyme-based biomanufacturing systems to produce commercially important molecules and chemicals for everyday life, announced a corporate name change to eXoZymes, Inc. (“eXoZymes”) and […]",
